# Normalise line endings in the repository, and check them on the way in.
# Without this, a Windows contributor's CRLF turns every touched line into a
# diff. This was a real defect in this family, recorded in qualityforge's
# CHANGELOG under PR #37.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webm binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.pdf binary
*.session binary
